gap-3 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-ink\">ClickUp</span><span class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f3f4f7] text-muted\" aria-label=\"Not available\" title=\"Not available\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-ink\">Asana</span><span class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f3f4f7] text-muted\" aria-label=\"Not available\" title=\"Not available\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-ink\">Jira</span><span class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f3f4f7] text-muted\" aria-label=\"Not available\" title=\"Not available\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-ink\">Twenty</span><span class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f3f4f7] text-muted\" aria-label=\"Not available\" title=\"Not available\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-ink\">Wrike</span><span class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f3f4f7] text-muted\" aria-label=\"Not available\" title=\"Not available\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></li></ul></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">✓ Native · ~ Partial · ✗ Not available<!-- --> · <!-- -->Sana (Workday) = learning-first, enterprise, horizontal. PYNGYN = PS-native, SMB, operationally deep.<!-- --> Last reviewed May 2026.</p></section><section class=\"wrap pb-[60px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Deep dives</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">See PYNGYN against each tool in your stack.</h2><p class=\"lead mt-3 max-w-[760px]\">Every comparison covers the same eight capabilities, the differences that matter, a migration plan, and FAQs.</p><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-[18px] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/notion/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->Notion</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">All-in-one workspace for docs, databases, and lightweight projects</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You run a consulting or services firm and need engagements, SOPs, AI, and deliverables in one operationally deep platform, not a database you have to keep duct-taping together.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/sana-labs/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->Sana Labs</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">Learning-first, enterprise, horizontal AI platform (now Workday)</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You&#x27;re a professional services firm that needs an operating system for engagements, SOPs, and delivery, priced for SMB and ready in days, not quarters.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/guru/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->Guru</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">AI-powered enterprise knowledge management</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You need knowledge to drive action (engagements, SOPs, deliverables), not just to be searchable in Slack.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/atlas/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->Atlas</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">Adjacent PS / consulting workspace tooling</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You want a single, PS-native operating platform with active SOPs, unified knowledge + tasks, and AI grounded in your firm&#x27;s context.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/clickup/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->ClickUp</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">Configurable everything-app for tasks, docs, and dashboards</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You run a consulting or services firm and want an opinionated operating platform that already knows what &#x27;engagement&#x27;, &#x27;utilization&#x27;, and &#x27;SOP&#x27; mean.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/asana/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->Asana</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">Work management for cross-functional projects, goals, and reporting</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You run a consulting or services firm and need an operating system for engagements, SOPs, knowledge, and AI, not just task lists, timelines, and portfolio dashboards.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/jira/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->Jira</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">Atlassian&#x27;s issue tracker for software teams, sprints, and backlogs</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You run a consulting, services, or delivery firm and need an operating system designed for engagements, SOWs, utilization, and SOPs, not sprints, story points, and bug backlogs.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/twenty/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->Twenty</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">Open-source CRM and customer workspace, a Salesforce/HubSpot alternative</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You need an operating system for delivery (engagements, utilization, SOWs, SOPs, deliverables, and AI grounded in your firm&#x27;s context), not a sales CRM.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a><a class=\"card group flex h-full flex-col\" href=\"/compare/wrike/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">PYNGYN vs <!-- -->Wrike</span><span class=\"text-accent transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">Collaborative work management for agencies, marketing, and PMOs</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You run a professional-services or consulting firm and want engagements, utilization, and client-facing status built in, plus a client portal you don&#x27;t have to configure from scratch.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Capability matrix</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">Migration plan</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1\">FAQs</span></div></a></div></section><section class=\"wrap pb-[60px]\"><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">How we compare</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3 text-[clamp(26px,3vw,36px)]\">PS-native. SMB. Operationally deep.</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-semibold\">Built for professional services</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Engagements, utilization, SOWs, deliverables, and methodologies are first-class, not adapted from a generic doc or task tool.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-semibold\">Knowledge that drives action</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">SOPs execute inside the workflow with checklists, gates, and AI assists. The playbook isn&#x27;t a doc, it&#x27;s how the firm runs.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-semibold\">Honest about the fit</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Every comparison page calls out where the other tool is the better choice. PYNGYN isn&#x27;t for every team.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop managing the tool. Start shipping the work.</h2><p class=\"lead relative mx-auto mt-[18px]\">See PYNGYN run a real project in 30 minutes, and let AI handle the project management busywork.</p><div class=\"relative mt-[30px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo →</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a></div><p class=\"relative mt-4 text-sm text-muted\">30-minute walkthrough · Tailored to your team · No commitment</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-white pt-16 pb-10 text-sm text-muted\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(5,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"mb-4 inline-block\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async